OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some late sunshine. Clear
OL,7,Fspells developing for a while tonight,
OL,8,Fbut clouding over later in the night
OL,9,Fperhaps with a few showers towards
OL,10,Fdawn. A fairly mild night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery rain
OL,13,Fmoving through during the morning,
OL,14,Fperhaps turning heavy at times.
OL,15,FBecoming dry and warm from late
OL,16,Fmorning, with some bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
